      "params": {
        "text": "ChIP-Seq pipeline: aligns reads, calls peaks with MACS2, and generates enrichment profiles.\n\nData source: Zenodo record 1324070 (Galaxy Training Material).\nwt_H3K4me3_read1.fastq (8.5M), wt_H3K4me3_read2.fastq (8.5M).\nMouse H3K4me3 ChIP-seq from 'Formation of the Super-Structures on the Inactive X' tutorial.\nURL: https://zenodo.org/record/1324070\nNote: Bowtie2 index directory is a placeholder. Provide your own index."
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Notes",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      }
    },
    {
